Subject: [PATCH] Material You: support system installation and GNOME 51 theme resources

Use the installed extension path, standard GNOME 51 CSS templates, and
local schema discovery for User Themes. Disconnect settings handlers on
disable and create output directories before asynchronous CSS writes.

